msgstr "It is what the office has found so far. It does not make a content item true: every content item is assessed anyway."

msgid "L'ufficio non ha un'esperienza che basti. Ogni contenuto si verifica da sé."
msgstr "The office does not have enough experience. Every content item is checked on its own."

msgid "È ciò che l'ufficio ha riscontrato finora. Non rende falso un contenuto: ogni contenuto si valuta comunque."
msgstr "It is what the office has found so far. It does not make a content item false: every content item is assessed anyway."

