msgstr "The certificate is there, but its key cannot be reached. If the key is on a device, insert the device before signing."

msgid "Il certificato è scaduto, o non vale ancora."
msgstr "The certificate has expired, or is not valid yet."

msgid "Il certificato non è fatto per firmare."
msgstr "The certificate is not made for signing."

